{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1262411-god-kicking-boots","id":1262411,"title":"God-Kicking Boots","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-10-23T14:26:34-07:00","id":1262411,"title":"God-Kicking Boots","content":"I'm thinking something like Bashing, Brawl, Smashing, Worn for tags, but Medium or Light for size?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1581-tonberrian","name":"tonberrian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"109"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-23T15:52:35-07:00","id":1262428,"title":"","content":"I would think light, mainly because all current brawl weapons are light and adding a medium brawl weapon would change the nature of brawl.<br /> Additionally, medium weapons get +1 parry, which both seems out of flavor for boots and a thing which might be denied to brawl on purpose.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23597-autxauty","name":"autXautY","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"286"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-23T17:36:13-07:00","id":1262440,"title":"","content":"I'd either make 'em mechanically identical to Smashfists...or if I wanted to drive home that kicks are both harder-hitting and harder to block than punches I'd use Heavy stats, but kicking with the force of a goremaul seems like it might be a bit too much. Probably just stick to Medium and flavor the defense bonus as &quot;it is hard to attack somebody who is roundhouse kicking you in the face with magic boots.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-23T20:16:30-07:00","id":1262459,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wise Old Guru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1262411-god-kicking-boots?p=1262440#post1262440\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd either make 'em mechanically identical to Smashfists...or if I wanted to drive home that kicks are both harder-hitting and harder to block than punches I'd use Heavy stats, but kicking with the force of a goremaul seems like it might be a bit too much. Probably just stick to Medium and flavor the defense bonus as &quot;it is hard to attack somebody who is roundhouse kicking you in the face with magic boots.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Heh. Seeing you in this thread is amusing, given that I initially assumed it was a thread about your comic.<br /> <br /> The artifacts themselves never really stood out that much compared to, like, perfected boots.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/357-plotvitalnpc","name":"PlotVitalNPC","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar357_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-23T21:07:23-07:00","id":1262468,"title":"","content":"Perfected boots? What are those?<br /> <br /> And balance-wise, I'm not TOO concerned, since Claws x2 does give you Medium unarmed attacks, and the defense boost is the biggest part of the Medium weapon stats.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1581-tonberrian","name":"tonberrian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"109"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-23T21:15:00-07:00","id":1262471,"title":"","content":"Nevermind.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-24T06:47:12-07:00","id":1262517,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tonberrian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1262411-god-kicking-boots?p=1262468#post1262468\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">... since Claws x2 does give you Medium unarmed attacks...</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm not finding that. What exactly are you referring to?<br /> <br /> edit: nvm, I realized you meant the mutation, not the weapon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksha are my fae-vorite.<br /> <br /> Reincarnation of magnificentmomo.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1542-morosemorgan","name":"MoroseMorgan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1542_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"778"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-24T07:03:26-07:00","id":1262518,"title":"","content":"My Chosen of Journeys has a pair that are statistically identical to smashfists but with some of the evocations enhancing her movement.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-24T09:53:54-07:00","id":1262544,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tonberrian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1262411-god-kicking-boots?p=1262468#post1262468\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Perfected boots? What are those?<br /> <br /> And balance-wise, I'm not TOO concerned, since Claws x2 does give you Medium unarmed attacks, and the defense boost is the biggest part of the Medium weapon stats.</div> </div> </div> </div>Perfected boots are an artifact from 2e that are basically really comfortable, indestructible boots which let fairly typical people march at speeds similar to cavalry.<br /> I was joking about what kind of 'X boot' I would wear, given that I only have one pair of feet to wear them on.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/357-plotvitalnpc","name":"PlotVitalNPC","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar357_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-24T11:07:22-07:00","id":1262556,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1262411-god-kicking-boots?p=1262518#post1262518\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My Chosen of Journeys has a pair that are statistically identical to smashfists but with some of the evocations enhancing her movement.</div> </div> </div> </div>TBH, I think that's the best way to do them.<br /> <br /> Light, Bashing, Worn, Smash seems fair. I can't really see any other tags as appropriate, or sizes. I don't really see that they should do more damage, or be better defensively.<br /> <br /> Whereas, evocation-wise, they could be quite different.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-24T12:28:12-07:00","id":1262564,"title":"","content":"We should be getting them in the Lunars book!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-24T22:59:14-07:00","id":1262632,"title":"","content":"The only thing I want out of God-Kicking Boots is an evocation called Boot To The Face.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ultimate Jade-Screened Exalted Scholar, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1304239-my-next-campaign-tdhr-peach\" target=\"_blank\">THDR : Future Dragon-Blooded campaign</a>, and other links.<br /> If you like Ex3, you can support <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/holdensh